### 1. Login Request (Retrieve JWT Token)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8084/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

> {%
    // Store the returned jwtToken into global variable 'auth_token'
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.jwtToken);
%}

###

### 2. Validate Token Request (Pass stored token in Authorization Header)
GET http://localhost:8084/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 3. Invalid Login Request (Should Return 401 with ErrorResponseDTO)
POST http://localhost:8084/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "WRONG_PASSWORD"
}